arena gifts
the arena gifts are a bunch of some rare and valuable items of the game. these items can only be acquired by winning ten times in one of the three arenas.
keep in mind that you don't need to win ten times in a ro. for instance, let's say you participate in one of the arenas and win a match. consiquently your victory count will increase by one. you participate again, however this time you are defeated. your victory count will not decrease, instead it will remain the same as before, so when the next time you win your victory count will increase.
in order to claim the gift you must win ten times. once you win your tenth victory a menu will pop in front of you, from which you can select your gift. keep in mind that you can select only a single gift, so choose wisely!
once you claim your gift your victory count will go back to 0, and you will have to make it go to ten again in order to claim another gift.
important note: there are different victory counts for different arenas. this means that if you win two times in the normal arena, and win again in the melee arena, your victory count will not increase by three. instead you will have two victories for the arena, and one for the melee arena. you must have ten victories in one of the arenas to claim your gift.
to check your victory stats you can press control plus A at the same time.